    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播：川子/阿彤</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：佳明</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>声音后期：川子</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>封面：阿彤</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎来到串通俱乐部，本期节目我们邀请了佳明同学，给我们讲述他这段时间只身前往横店做演员的故事，从群演到现在主演的经历～如果您有问题或故事，可以分享在评论区～～</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 佳明去横店演戏的动机。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a> 离开北京，抵达横店演艺生活的开始。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a> 第一个短剧上线了，角色是个“突厥首领”。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a> 拍第一部戏后的感想---累。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 小剧组也分三六九等。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 印象中深刻、奇葩的剧组。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 演戏过程中的成长。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2903">48:23</a> 佳明对想演戏同学的建议。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3163">52:43</a> 剧组中的“潜规则”、“辛酸史”。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3530">58:50</a> 在横店遇到个“精神病”。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小时候参加大张伟的综艺剧照：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoTsYjmP8koCAKfCLHf8mrdbFEHL.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmGbPOThq-Sooa_aY7CBKKYSvEuW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>⬇️横店的剧照⬇️</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvjJI33XicnnlK4Jo-EJKkzVuoPe.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net