    <title>NO.16 “大不敬”！吐槽上代人的小习惯～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6805abf51f1db84a568cc86c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6805abf51f1db84a568cc86c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Apr 2025 02:33:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：川子/阿彤</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：佳明</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音后期：川子</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：阿彤</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来到串通俱乐部，本期节目我们聊一个关于和长辈之间的观念差异话题，分享我们在日常生活中发现一些“匪夷所思”的搞笑故事～如果您也有故事要分享，可以分享在评论区～～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 关于老年人那些“讲究”的习惯。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 老人受骗上当的荒谬故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a> 家里的家电、家居必盖块儿布。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1308">21:48</a> 长辈看抖音的状态。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1438">23:58</a> 小时候总能吃到蒜味儿的西瓜。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> 长辈们那些各种过度节俭的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2003">33:23</a> 老头“擤鼻涕”的能力太强了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2112">35:12</a> 关于长辈对烫水的痴迷。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2543">42:23</a> 对剩饭剩菜的节俭。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2772">46:12</a> 长辈对外卖的厌恶。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 关于和长辈的聊天方式的不同。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3015">50:15</a> 长辈那些生活中过度节俭的事件。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⬇️⬇️⬇️</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家收听，如有投稿可联系：ctclubofficial@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>获取最新消息可在小红书/抖音/微信公众号搜索：串通俱乐部</span></p>]]></description>
