  <item>
    <title>NO.6 冤枉钱清单。谁还没花过点冤枉钱！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677590d11e823e72d3836862</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677590d11e823e72d3836862</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2025 20:15:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：川子/阿彤</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：佳明</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音后期：川子</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：阿彤</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来到串通俱乐部，抱歉拖更了一天～这次聊点伤心的，冤枉钱！谁还没花过点冤枉钱呢（微笑）？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 无关话题：恭喜佳明接了部戏。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 开始正题：介绍并且感叹一下冤枉钱这件事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 常见的一些小例子，电视有奖竞猜，早餐机，618和双11等。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="378">06:18</a> 川子的长期迟到扣钱经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> 健身卡，大多数人都办过。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> 去玩刮刮乐，中了奖反而赔钱了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> 婚纱照，做好心理建设结果还是没忍住诱惑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 一次有关通马桶的惨痛经历！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 一个喷嚏眼前一黑，腰疼找了个盲人按摩越按越疼，去医院查出了真正原因。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a> 治打呼噜神器的工作原理。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a> 一个悲惨的事件，一只悲惨的狗，一位悲惨的主人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 投资两台游戏机，惨遭现实洗礼。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> 买基金的教训。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 上了某些保险是冤枉钱，不上某些保险会花冤枉钱。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2800">46:40</a> 绝杀的经历！花了冤枉钱，伤了心，还差点留了案底。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3235">53:55</a> 避免冤枉钱，祝各位每一笔消费都是物有所值。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家收听，如有投稿可联系：ctclubofficial@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnaROf3TnPLlq6RTbp6Y6Hi8i6ga.m4a" length="107909809" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj4oufRofyy_bA4XksJFHVeLc3JZ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>NO.5 童年系列：我们的电子精神食粮。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676aedb91e823e72d37aa76c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676aedb91e823e72d37aa76c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Dec 2024 00:18:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：川子/阿彤</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：佳明</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音后期：川子</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：阿彤</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来到串通俱乐部，我们决定做一个关于90后童年回忆的系列，这次是我们本系列的第一集，探讨一下我们的“电子精神食粮”游戏和网络~欢迎大家收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> 我们后期会更新童年系列的内容，例如：吃喝玩乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 这期我们先聊我们小时候玩过的电脑游戏。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 小时候玩过的小霸王游戏机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> 冒险岛、超级玛丽和魂斗罗的游戏回忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">09:47</a> 游戏厅里游戏回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> 红警2的游戏回忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> 川子小时候去网吧打CS，还组过战队打半职业。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a> 阿彤小时候因为QQ宠物生病，着急上火的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> 川子小时候拿小卖部电话充值Q币的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">23:18</a> 金山修改器发现英雄联盟的BUG。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> 关于单机游戏的游戏回忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 大家刚开始接触 qq 干的傻事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1883">31:23</a> 佳明同学当初为了省点儿点卡玩梦幻西游都干了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 小时候为 qq 充过的钱。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">36:04</a> 阿彤的妈妈捡了200块钱，阿彤干了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2192">36:32</a> 关于网游的回忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3053">50:53</a> 曾经打游戏的时候经常欺负电脑配置低得玩家。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a> 期待2025年的GTA6和双人成行2的游戏。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3199">53:19</a> 佳明同学打彩虹6号的时候，把自己摔了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3426">57:06</a> 祝愿大家都有一个属于自己的时间和空间，把自己的压力卸掉，能踏踏实实的娱乐一下~</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家收听，如有投稿可联系：ctclubofficial@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrAAQgpBvOHjlt3BqfKCYYRyBtUO.m4a" length="112897817" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs9fC35d5Vc48-4lbrsu6tGVLK0W.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>NO.4 文明的黑洞，无意冒犯还是有意为之？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6761b5b97d8426f692e9ba38</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6761b5b97d8426f692e9ba38</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Dec 2024 19:48:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：川子/阿彤</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：佳明、豆丁</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音后期：川子</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：阿彤</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来到串通俱乐部，今天说的是，有关素质的话题，聊聊我们那些被冒犯的经历。（但我们探讨的内容和观点，仅代表我们个人，如有不符，以您为准~）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 关于佳明同学前一天住川子家，打的呼噜声把川子两口子家的猫吓够呛。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> 关于素质的分类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 家长的责任对孩子的素质影响。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> &nbsp;社会上的影响。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> 垃圾分类的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a> 充电桩充电，油车占充电桩车位。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 阿彤、佳明分享被人插队的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1563">26:03</a> 豆丁分享电动车的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 关于道路安全。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 遭遇车辆紧急刹车经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 在公司里遇到的各种各样的同事们。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2884">48:04</a> 川子和阿彤在参加婚礼的路上，开车右拐没小心撞到一个老人的发生奇妙缘分的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3250">54:10</a> 在公司里因为刷门禁引发的鲜明对比。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3386">56:26</a> 川子上大学在食堂发生的搞笑故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3556">59:16</a> 佳明小时候在网吧遇到得故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3633">1:00:33</a> 在公共交通遇到没素质的事情。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3955">1:05:55</a> 豆丁遇到被冒犯的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4305">1:11:45</a> 总结：君子以是非占立场，小人以立场辨是非。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家收听，如有投稿可联系：ctclubofficial@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpul6kQzj53tihIUM1AjHRMhY9os.m4a" length="144646412" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmO0JWEFHdvU8UVWSUhE8NbK3FHN.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
